  "story": {
    "day": 57,
    "title": "A Sunday Video Call",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a beautiful day, so Kaya got up early.",
      "In the morning, she studied hard because she had a test.",
      "After that, she enjoyed tennis practice in the afternoon.",
      "She was an active girl and loved this sport.",
      "Then, she walked home and wanted to play a video game.",
      "But first, she cooked a lovely Mexican meal for her family.",
      "Her cousin lived in Mexico, but moved to Sydney last week.",
      "Next, Kaya made a video call to her cousin.",
      "\"I miss you very much,\" Kaya said.",
      "\"We aren't close, but don't worry,\" her cousin smiled.",
      "They listened to music together and talked about their day.",
      "Finally, Kaya turned off the computer and went to sleep."
    ]
  }
